/* lhde's look for Firefox's own chrome (userChrome.css): for the Longhorn themes the Longhorn navigation (--look longhorn,
   the default with glass: the longhorn section, with lhglass on the glass or lhopaque without it), Firefox 4's look on
   Windows 7 (--look ff4, the default without glass, and the fallback of the Longhorn navigation under a glass theme while
   there is no compositor: the ff4 and ff4glass sections) or the Longhorn Explorer header (--look explorer: the explorer
   section); Firefox 4's look on XP for the XP and classic themes (xp). Template of tools/lhde-firefox, which writes the
   theme's values into the block of custom properties below (from liblhde's resolver and the visual style through ut-dump)
   and keeps the sections of the look, wrapping some in a media query; docs/USAGE.md "Firefox". Firefox 160's element ids
   (browser.xhtml, browser/omni.ja).

   The explorer section, measured against flxp's header (flxp/shell/ui/lhheader.cpp, navbar.cpp: 4074's framelet geometry, 4051's navigation bar):
   the band's height (the travel art's: 54 rows), its picture (the style's Navbar::Rebar BACKGROUND with its sizing margins),
   the travel buttons (TravelBack/TravelFwd::AnimationButton, 38 + 27 x 54, 2 px from the left edge), where the address
   starts (the breadcrumb's text x of the style's layout), the text colour (Navbar.TITLE), the face and size (the style's
   breadcrumb face: Tahoma 11 px for Slate, Segoe UI 12 px for Jade and Aero), the search box (160 x 20, 8 px from the right
   edge; vision: 180 x 21, 4 px). Firefox is not transparent on X11: where flxp's header is glass, the band is the style's
   opaque navigation bar, as flxp draws it without composition.
   Taste (Firefox's own parts, after Firefox 4's look): the address sits on the breadcrumb's row and shows as a field only
   while hovered or focused, the reload button and the other toolbar buttons at the right of the band's lower row, the tabs
   on a flat row below the band in its lower colour, the selected tab lighter and joined to the page, small close buttons. */

/*@VARS@*/

/* ---- both families ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
#navigator-toolbox {
  display: flex !important;
  flex-direction: column !important;
  font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important;
  border-bottom: 0 !important;
}
#PersonalToolbar { order: 3; }

/* the menu bar (Alt, or View > Toolbars > Menu Bar): Firefox's GTK menu bar items drawn as the theme's. Its height is set
   only while it is shown: Firefox collapses it with [inactive] (an !important user rule would win over that) */
#main-menubar > menu {
  appearance: none !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  border: 0 !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  background: none !important;
  color: inherit !important;
  font-family: var(--lhde-menu-font) !important;
  font-size: var(--lhde-menu-font-size) !important;
}
#main-menubar > menu > .menubar-text, #main-menubar > menu > label { margin: 0 !important; color: inherit !important; }
#toolbar-menubar .titlebar-buttonbox-container, #toolbar-menubar .titlebar-spacer { display: none !important; }

/* things with no place in the period's header */
#nav-bar toolbarspring,
#nav-bar .titlebar-spacer,
#TabsToolbar .titlebar-spacer,
#sidebar-button,
#firefox-view-button,
#alltabs-button,
#taskbar-tabs-favicon,
#tracking-protection-icon-container,
#urlbar .urlbar-go-button,
#nav-bar-overflow-button:not([overflowedItem]) { display: none !important; }

#nav-bar .toolbarbutton-1:not(#back-button, #forward-button) {
  --toolbarbutton-inner-padding: 3px !important;
  --toolbarbutton-outer-padding: 1px !important;
  --toolbarbutton-border-radius: 2px !important;
}

/*@IF explorer@*/
/* ---- the Longhorn header band ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
:root {
  --toolbar-bgcolor: var(--lhde-band-low) !important;
  --toolbar-color: var(--lhde-text) !important;
  --toolbox-bgcolor: var(--lhde-band-low) !important;
  --toolbox-bgcolor-inactive: var(--lhde-band-low) !important;
  --toolbox-textcolor: var(--lhde-tab-text) !important;
  --tabs-navbar-separator-style: none !important;
  --toolbarbutton-icon-fill: var(--lhde-text) !important;
  --urlbar-height: var(--lhde-field-h) !important;
  --urlbar-container-height: var(--lhde-field-h) !important;
  --toolbar-field-background-color: transparent !important;
  --toolbar-field-color: var(--lhde-text) !important;
  --toolbar-field-border-color: transparent !important;
  --toolbar-field-focus-background-color: #ffffff !important;
  --toolbar-field-focus-color: #000000 !important;
  --toolbar-field-focus-border-color: var(--lhde-field-border) !important;
  --urlbar-border-radius: 0px !important;
  --urlbarview-border-radius: 0px !important;
  --tab-border-radius: 0px !important;
  --tab-min-height: var(--lhde-tab-h) !important;
  --tab-block-margin: 0px !important;
  --tab-margin-block: 0px !important;
  --tab-shadow-max-size: 0px !important;
  --tab-selected-shadow: none !important;
  --tab-box-shadow-selected: none !important;
  --tab-background-color: transparent !important;
  --tab-background-color-hover: var(--lhde-tab-hover) !important;
  --tab-background-color-selected: var(--lhde-tab-selected) !important;
  --tab-selected-bgcolor: var(--lhde-tab-selected) !important;
  --tab-border: none !important;
  --tab-border-color: transparent !important;
  --tab-border-color-selected: transparent !important;
  --tab-text-color: var(--lhde-tab-text) !important;
  --tab-text-color-hover: var(--lhde-tab-text) !important;
  --tab-text-color-selected: var(--lhde-tab-selected-text) !important;
}

#nav-bar {
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  height: var(--lhde-band-h) !important;
  min-height: var(--lhde-band-h) !important;
  max-height: var(--lhde-band-h) !important;
  padding: 0 var(--lhde-search-right) 0 var(--lhde-nav-x) !important;
  background-color: var(--lhde-band-color) !important;
  background-image: none !important;
  border: 0 !important;
  border-image-source: var(--lhde-band-image) !important;
  border-image-slice: var(--lhde-band-slice) fill !important;
  border-image-width: var(--lhde-band-border) !important;
  border-image-repeat: stretch !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  color: var(--lhde-text) !important;
  align-items: stretch !important;
}
:root:-moz-window-inactive #nav-bar {
  border-image-source: var(--lhde-band-image-inactive) !important;
  background-color: var(--lhde-band-color-inactive) !important;
  color: var(--lhde-text-inactive) !important;
}
#nav-bar { order: 0; }
#toolbar-menubar { order: 1; }
#TabsToolbar { order: 2; }

/* the menu bar: flxp's menu band under the header (flxp/explorer/lhbar.cpp: Slate's Document::Rebar strip, 22 rows, white
   menu-font text, ExplorerMenu::Toolbar.BUTTON as the hot and pressed frames over the band's full height; the first item's
   frame 2 px from the left edge, its text 9 px inside the frame: measured on flxp slate4051 and jade4074) */
#toolbar-menubar:not([inactive]) {
  height: var(--lhde-menu-h) !important;
  min-height: var(--lhde-menu-h) !important;
  max-height: var(--lhde-menu-h) !important;
}
#toolbar-menubar {
  padding: 0 0 0 2px !important;
  border: 0 !important;
  background-color: transparent !important;
  background-image: var(--lhde-menu-bg) !important;
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px var(--lhde-menu-highlight) !important;
  border-image-source: var(--lhde-menu-image) !important;
  border-image-slice: 1 1 0 1 fill !important;
  border-image-width: 1px 1px 0 1px !important;
  border-image-repeat: stretch !important;
  color: var(--lhde-menu-text) !important;
}
:root:-moz-window-inactive #toolbar-menubar { color: var(--lhde-menu-text-inactive) !important; }
#toolbar-menubar > .toolbar-items, #menubar-items, #main-menubar { height: var(--lhde-menu-h) !important; align-items: stretch !important; }
#main-menubar > menu {
  padding: 0 8px 0 9px !important;
  min-height: var(--lhde-menu-h) !important;
}
#main-menubar > menu:is([_moz-menuactive="true"], :hover) {
  border-image: var(--lhde-menu-hot) 5 fill / 5px stretch !important;
}
#main-menubar > menu[open] { border-image: var(--lhde-menu-pressed) 5 fill / 5px stretch !important; }

/* the travel buttons fill the band's height, the rest sits on the breadcrumb's row */
#nav-bar-customization-target {
  align-items: flex-end !important;
  height: var(--lhde-band-h) !important;
}
#nav-bar-customization-target > * { margin-bottom: var(--lhde-row-bottom) !important; }

/* the travel buttons: the style's TravelBack and TravelFwd art, the forward plate continuing the back plate */
#back-button, #forward-button {
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  align-self: stretch !important;
  height: var(--lhde-travel-h) !important;
  margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  background: var(--lhde-back-normal) no-repeat left top / 100% 100% !important;
  width: var(--lhde-back-w) !important;
  min-width: var(--lhde-back-w) !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  list-style-image: var(--lhde-back-glyph) !important;
  -moz-context-properties: fill !important;
  fill: var(--lhde-text) !important;
}
#forward-button {
  background-image: var(--lhde-fwd-normal) !important;
  width: var(--lhde-fwd-w) !important;
  min-width: var(--lhde-fwd-w) !important;
  list-style-image: var(--lhde-fwd-glyph) !important;
}
#back-button > .toolbarbutton-icon, #forward-button > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  background: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  width: var(--lhde-glyph-size) !important;
  height: var(--lhde-glyph-size) !important;
}
#back-button[disabled] > .toolbarbutton-icon, #forward-button[disabled] > .toolbarbutton-icon { opacity: 1 !important; }
#back-button:not([disabled]):hover { background-image: var(--lhde-back-hot) !important; }
#back-button:not([disabled]):is(:hover:active, [open]) { background-image: var(--lhde-back-pressed) !important; }
#back-button[disabled] { background-image: var(--lhde-back-disabled) !important; }
#forward-button:not([disabled]):hover { background-image: var(--lhde-fwd-hot) !important; }
#forward-button:not([disabled]):is(:hover:active, [open]) { background-image: var(--lhde-fwd-pressed) !important; }
#forward-button[disabled] { background-image: var(--lhde-fwd-disabled) !important; }

/* the address on the breadcrumb's row, from the crumbs' x; a field only while hovered or focused (flxp's address edit) */
#stop-reload-button { order: 2; }
#urlbar-container {
  order: 1;
  flex: 1 1 auto !important;
  width: auto !important;
  max-width: none !important;
  margin-inline: var(--lhde-crumb-gap) 6px !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  height: var(--lhde-field-h) !important;
  min-height: var(--lhde-field-h) !important;
  --urlbar-container-padding-block: 0px !important;
  font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important;
  font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important;
}
#urlbar {
  font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important;
  font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important;
  text-shadow: var(--lhde-text-shadow) !important;
}
#urlbar:not([focused], [open]):hover > .urlbar-background {
  background-color: var(--lhde-field-hover) !important;
  border: 1px solid var(--lhde-field-border) !important;
}
#urlbar:is([focused], [open]) { text-shadow: none !important; }
#urlbar-input, #urlbar .urlbar-input { font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important; font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important; }
#identity-box, #page-action-buttons, #star-button-box { opacity: 0.85; }

/* the search box at the right, as flxp's */
#search-container {
  order: 3;
  --toolbar-field-color: #000000 !important;
  --toolbar-field-background-color: var(--lhde-search-bg) !important;
  --toolbarbutton-icon-fill: #000000 !important;
  color: #000000 !important;
  text-shadow: none !important;
  min-width: var(--lhde-search-w) !important;
  max-width: var(--lhde-search-w) !important;
  width: var(--lhde-search-w) !important;
  margin-inline: 8px 0 !important;
  height: var(--lhde-search-h) !important;
  font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important;
  font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important;
}
#search-container .urlbar-background, #searchbar, #searchbar-new .urlbar-background {
  background-color: var(--lhde-search-bg) !important;
  border: 1px solid var(--lhde-field-border) !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
}
#search-container .urlbar, #searchbar-new { --urlbar-height: var(--lhde-search-h) !important; min-height: var(--lhde-search-h) !important; }
#nav-bar-customization-target > :is(#downloads-button, #unified-extensions-button, #fxa-toolbar-menu-button,
  #PanelUI-button, #library-button, #home-button, #stop-reload-button) { order: 4; }
#PanelUI-button { margin-bottom: var(--lhde-row-bottom) !important; align-self: flex-end !important; }
#PanelUI-menu-button, #unified-extensions-button, #fxa-toolbar-menu-button, #downloads-button { opacity: 0.9; }

/* the tabs: a flat row below the band in its lower colour, the selected tab lighter and joined to the page. The band's own
   last row is its line (Slate's dark one, Jade's blue one), as flxp's header ends on it (lhheader.cpp paint_bottom) and its
   menu band follows at once: no border of the row's own above it, or the line is doubled */
#TabsToolbar {
  background: var(--lhde-band-low) !important;
  border-top: 0 !important;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--lhde-tab-line) !important;
  color: var(--lhde-tab-text) !important;
  min-height: 0 !important;
}
#TabsToolbar .toolbar-items, #tabbrowser-tabs, #tabbrowser-arrowscrollbox { min-height: var(--lhde-tab-h) !important; }
#tabbrowser-tabs { --tab-min-height: var(--lhde-tab-h) !important; padding-inline: 0 !important; border: 0 !important; }
.tabbrowser-tab {
  padding: 0 !important;
  min-height: var(--lhde-tab-h) !important;
  font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important;
  font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important;
}
.tabbrowser-tab + .tabbrowser-tab:not([visuallyselected]) .tab-background,
.tabbrowser-tab:not([visuallyselected]) + .tabbrowser-tab .tab-background { border-left: 1px solid var(--lhde-tab-sep) !important; }
.tab-background {
  margin: 0 !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  outline: none !important;
  min-height: var(--lhde-tab-h) !important;
}
.tab-background:is([selected], [multiselected]) {
  background: var(--lhde-tab-selected) !important;
  border-left: 1px solid var(--lhde-tab-line) !important;
  border-right: 1px solid var(--lhde-tab-line) !important;
}
.tabbrowser-tab { color: var(--lhde-tab-text) !important; }
.tabbrowser-tab[visuallyselected] { color: var(--lhde-tab-selected-text) !important; }
.tab-content { padding-inline: 6px 2px !important; }
.tab-label { font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important; font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important; }
.tab-close-button {
  width: 16px !important;
  height: 16px !important;
  padding: 3px !important;
  margin-inline-end: 0 !important;
}
#tabs-newtab-button, #new-tab-button { --toolbarbutton-inner-padding: 3px !important; }
#tabbrowser-tabs .tabbrowser-tab:not([visuallyselected]) .tab-label { opacity: 0.95; }
/*@END@*/

/*@IF longhorn@*/
/* ---- the Longhorn navigation ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
/* After the Longhorn browser concepts of 2004 (glass window, a round Back at the left, the page's title over the address,
   which takes the width, a round refresh after it, the favourites star at the right, document tabs below that band, then
   the page), built from flxp's Small header, the measured Longhorn header the file dialog and mupf use
   (flxp/shell/ui/lhheader.cpp): luxwm's caption keeps the title (Firefox's window title, the page's: the concept's title
   over the address), then the 36-row band with the travel art (SmallTravelBack, 27 x 36 at x 2, filling the band), the
   address on the row of its disc (centre row 14), the star (SmallFavorites, 27 x 27 on the band's first row, 4 px from
   the right edge). Under the glass themes the band and the tab row are luxwm's glass ([extend_frame] firefox = band + tab
   row: lhde-firefox install); the tab row's last 2 rows are left to luxwm's inner edge lines, which then run on down the
   sides: the outline the content sits in, as on flxp.
   From the concept (its first picture: the address 21 rows with corners of 3 px, a dark top edge with a soft shade under
   it, lighter sides and bottom, the fill hardly lighter than the glass; tabs 23 rows high, square-shouldered with 2 px
   corners, a dark outer edge and a light inner one, a glossy fill lighter in its upper half, the selected one near white
   and the others the glass lightened, dark grey text; all over the line the content starts below): the shapes and the
   relations of the colours to the glass, as translucent fills, since the glass is the theme's and not the concept's peach.
   Choices: no Forward button (the concept has none; Alt+Right and the Back button's history menu remain); the address
   searches too, no search box (Firefox's Settings > Search can put it back); the hamburger and the other toolbar buttons
   kept small between the refresh button and the star; the tab text in flxp's breadcrumb face and size (12 px Segoe UI,
   the concept's 13 px at its own scale) and 16 px favicons (the concept's 13 px icons are drawn ones). */
:root {
  --toolbar-bgcolor: transparent !important;
  --toolbar-color: #000000 !important;
  --toolbox-textcolor: #000000 !important;
  --toolbox-textcolor-inactive: #000000 !important;
  --tabs-navbar-separator-style: none !important;
  --toolbarbutton-icon-fill: #000000 !important;
  --toolbarbutton-hover-background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35) !important;
  --toolbarbutton-active-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12) !important;
  --toolbar-field-background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35) !important;
  --toolbar-field-color: #000000 !important;
  --toolbar-field-border-color: transparent !important;
  --toolbar-field-focus-background-color: #ffffff !important;
  --toolbar-field-focus-color: #000000 !important;
  --toolbar-field-focus-border-color: transparent !important;
  --urlbar-height: 21px !important;
  --urlbar-min-height: 21px !important;
  --urlbar-container-height: 21px !important;
  --urlbar-border-radius: 3px !important;
  --urlbarview-border-radius: 0px !important;
  --tab-border-radius: 0px !important;
  --tab-min-height: var(--lhde-lh-tab-h) !important;
  --tab-block-margin: 0px !important;
  --tab-margin-block: 0px !important;
  --tab-shadow-max-size: 0px !important;
  --tab-selected-shadow: none !important;
  --tab-box-shadow-selected: none !important;
  --tab-background-color: transparent !important;
  --tab-background-color-selected: transparent !important;
  --tab-selected-bgcolor: transparent !important;
  --tab-background-color-hover: transparent !important;
  --tab-text-color: #45403d !important;
  --tab-text-color-selected: #45403d !important;
  --tab-border: none !important;
  /* the content's top edge is luxwm's line (glass) or the toolbox's own (lhopaque): no separator of Firefox's under it */
  --chrome-content-separator-color: transparent !important;
  --content-area-shadow: none !important;
}
#nav-bar { order: 0; }
#toolbar-menubar { order: 1; }
#TabsToolbar { order: 2; }
#navigator-toolbox { border-bottom: 0 !important; }
.browserContainer { border-block-start: 0 !important; }
#nav-bar, #TabsToolbar, #PersonalToolbar, #toolbar-menubar {
  font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important;
  font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  border-top: 0 !important;
  border-bottom: 0 !important;
  background-color: transparent !important;
  background-image: none !important;
}

/* the band: the Small header's 36 rows; the travel art from x 2, everything else centred on its disc's row (14) */
#nav-bar {
  position: relative !important;
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  height: var(--lhde-lh-band-h) !important;
  min-height: var(--lhde-lh-band-h) !important;
  max-height: var(--lhde-lh-band-h) !important;
  padding: 0 calc(var(--lhde-lh-fav-w) + 17px) 0 var(--lhde-lh-travel-x) !important;
  align-items: flex-start !important;
  color: #000000 !important;
  /* the separator before the star (the concept's: a dark line with a light one beside it, the address's height) */
  background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28)),
                    linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5)) !important;
  background-size: 1px 21px, 1px 21px !important;
  background-position: right calc(var(--lhde-lh-fav-w) + 11px) top 4px, right calc(var(--lhde-lh-fav-w) + 10px) top 4px !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
}
#nav-bar-customization-target, #PanelUI-button {
  height: 28px !important;
  align-items: center !important;
}
#nav-bar-customization-target > *, #PanelUI-button { margin-block: 0 !important; }

/* Back: the style's art (flxp's Small Back plate; Vista's TravelBand left half), or a drawn orb */
#nav-bar #back-button {
  align-self: flex-start !important;
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  width: var(--lhde-lh-back-w) !important;
  min-width: var(--lhde-lh-back-w) !important;
  height: var(--lhde-lh-band-h) !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  background: var(--lhde-lh-back-normal) no-repeat !important;
  background-size: var(--lhde-lh-back-size) !important;
  background-position: 0 var(--lhde-lh-back-top) !important;
  list-style-image: var(--lhde-lh-back-glyph) !important;
  -moz-context-properties: fill !important;
  fill: #ffffff !important;
  opacity: 1 !important;
}
#nav-bar #back-button:not([disabled]):hover { background-image: var(--lhde-lh-back-hot) !important; }
#nav-bar #back-button:not([disabled]):is(:hover:active, [open]) { background-image: var(--lhde-lh-back-pressed) !important; }
#nav-bar #back-button[disabled] { background-image: var(--lhde-lh-back-disabled) !important; }
#nav-bar #back-button > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  width: var(--lhde-lh-orb-size) !important;
  height: var(--lhde-lh-orb-size) !important;
  min-height: 0 !important;
  margin: calc(14px - var(--lhde-lh-orb-size) / 2) 0 0 3px !important;
  padding: calc(var(--lhde-lh-orb-size) / 8) !important;
  border-radius: 50% !important;
  background: var(--lhde-lh-back-orb) !important;
  box-shadow: var(--lhde-lh-back-edge) !important;
  align-self: flex-start !important;
}
#nav-bar #back-button[disabled] > .toolbarbutton-icon { opacity: 1 !important; filter: saturate(0.2) !important; }
#nav-bar #forward-button { display: none !important; }

/* the address: in the breadcrumb row's place, from 8 px after the Back art to the refresh button; the concept's
   shallow recessed field (21 rows, 3 px corners, the dark top edge and its shade) */
#urlbar-container {
  order: 1;
  flex: 1 1 auto !important;
  width: auto !important;
  max-width: none !important;
  margin-inline: 8px 4px !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  height: 21px !important;
  min-height: 21px !important;
  --urlbar-container-padding-block: 0px !important;
}
#urlbar, #urlbar-input, #urlbar .urlbar-input, .urlbar-input-box {
  font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important;
  font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important;
}
#urlbar .urlbar-background, #search-container .urlbar-background, #searchbar-new .urlbar-background {
  border-radius: 3px !important;
  border: 1px solid !important;
  border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26) !important;
  background-color: var(--lhde-lh-field) !important;
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) !important;
  outline: none !important;
}
#urlbar:is([focused], [open]) .urlbar-background,
:is(#search-container, #searchbar-new) :is([focused], [open]) .urlbar-background { background-color: #ffffff !important; }
/* the search box, where Firefox's settings put it back: the address's field, flxp's vision search box's width */
#search-container {
  min-width: 180px !important;
  max-width: 180px !important;
  width: 180px !important;
  height: 21px !important;
  margin-inline: 0 4px !important;
  font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important;
  font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important;
}
#search-container .urlbar, #searchbar-new { --urlbar-height: 21px !important; min-height: 21px !important; }
#urlbar:not([focused], [open]) #urlbar-input { text-shadow: var(--lhde-lh-glow) !important; }
#identity-box, #page-action-buttons, #star-button-box { opacity: 0.85; }

/* refresh and stop: one small round button after the address (the concept's 20 px grey-blue ball), Firefox's glyphs */
#nav-bar #stop-reload-button { order: 2; margin-inline: 0 4px !important; }
#nav-bar #stop-reload-button > .toolbarbutton-1 { margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; }
#nav-bar #stop-reload-button > .toolbarbutton-1 > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  width: 20px !important;
  height: 20px !important;
  padding: 3px !important;
  border-radius: 50% !important;
  border: 1px solid rgba(60, 64, 90, 0.45) !important;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 25%, #eef1f6 0, #a9b3c6 48%, #6d7891 100%) !important;
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) !important;
  -moz-context-properties: fill !important;
  fill: #ffffff !important;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 0 transparent) !important;
}
#nav-bar #stop-reload-button > .toolbarbutton-1:not([disabled]):hover > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 25%, #f4f9ff 0, #8fb8e2 48%, #3f72b0 100%) !important;
}
#nav-bar #stop-reload-button > .toolbarbutton-1:not([disabled]):hover:active > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 70%, #e8edf4 0, #a9b4c6 55%, #7b849c 100%) !important;
}

/* the other buttons small on the glass, then the star: the bookmarks menu button (flxp's favorites star) at the band's
   right as flxp has it, the style's star art, or a drawn ball */
#nav-bar-customization-target > :is(#downloads-button, #unified-extensions-button, #fxa-toolbar-menu-button, #library-button,
  #home-button, #search-container) { order: 3; }
#nav-bar .toolbarbutton-1:not(#back-button, #reload-button, #stop-button, #bookmarks-menu-button) {
  --toolbarbutton-inner-padding: 3px !important;
  --toolbarbutton-outer-padding: 1px !important;
  --toolbarbutton-border-radius: 3px !important;
}
#nav-bar #bookmarks-menu-button {
  position: absolute !important;
  top: 0 !important;
  right: 4px !important;
  width: var(--lhde-lh-fav-w) !important;
  height: var(--lhde-lh-fav-h) !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  background: var(--lhde-lh-fav-normal) no-repeat 0 0 / 100% 100% !important;
  list-style-image: var(--lhde-lh-fav-glyph) !important;
  -moz-context-properties: fill !important;
  fill: #ffffff !important;
}
#nav-bar #bookmarks-menu-button:hover { background-image: var(--lhde-lh-fav-hot) !important; }
#nav-bar #bookmarks-menu-button:is(:hover:active, [open]) { background-image: var(--lhde-lh-fav-pressed) !important; }
#nav-bar #bookmarks-menu-button > .toolbarbutton-menu-dropmarker { display: none !important; }
#nav-bar #bookmarks-menu-button > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  width: var(--lhde-lh-fav-orb-size) !important;
  height: var(--lhde-lh-fav-orb-size) !important;
  margin: calc(14px - var(--lhde-lh-fav-orb-size) / 2) 0 0 calc(13px - var(--lhde-lh-fav-orb-size) / 2) !important;
  padding: calc(var(--lhde-lh-fav-orb-size) / 7) !important;
  border-radius: 50% !important;
  background: var(--lhde-lh-fav-orb) !important;
  box-shadow: var(--lhde-lh-fav-edge) !important;
}

/* the menu bar (Alt, or View > Toolbars > Menu Bar) between the band and the tabs: flxp's menu band under its header
   (flxp/explorer/lhbar.cpp: Slate's Document::Rebar strip, 22 rows, white menu-font text, ExplorerMenu::Toolbar.BUTTON
   as the hot and pressed frames over the band's full height, the first frame 2 px from the left edge) */
#toolbar-menubar:not([inactive]) {
  height: var(--lhde-menu-h) !important;
  min-height: var(--lhde-menu-h) !important;
  max-height: var(--lhde-menu-h) !important;
}
#toolbar-menubar {
  padding: 0 0 0 2px !important;
  background-image: var(--lhde-menu-bg) !important;
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px var(--lhde-menu-highlight) !important;
  border-image-source: var(--lhde-menu-image) !important;
  border-image-slice: 1 1 0 1 fill !important;
  border-image-width: 1px 1px 0 1px !important;
  border-image-repeat: stretch !important;
  color: var(--lhde-menu-text) !important;
}
:root:-moz-window-inactive #toolbar-menubar { color: var(--lhde-menu-text-inactive) !important; }
#toolbar-menubar > .toolbar-items, #menubar-items, #main-menubar { height: var(--lhde-menu-h) !important; align-items: stretch !important; }
#main-menubar > menu { padding: 0 8px 0 9px !important; min-height: var(--lhde-menu-h) !important; }
#main-menubar > menu:is([_moz-menuactive="true"], :hover) { border-image: var(--lhde-menu-hot) 5 fill / 5px stretch !important; }
#main-menubar > menu[open] { border-image: var(--lhde-menu-pressed) 5 fill / 5px stretch !important; }

/* the tab row: the concept's 23-row document tabs from the left edge, side by side, then the 2 rows of the line the
   content starts below (luxwm's inner edge lines on the glass) */
#TabsToolbar {
  padding: 0 0 2px !important;
  min-height: 0 !important;
  height: var(--lhde-lh-tabs-h) !important;
  max-height: var(--lhde-lh-tabs-h) !important;
  color: #000000 !important;
}
#TabsToolbar :is(.toolbar-items, #TabsToolbar-customization-target), #tabbrowser-tabs, #tabbrowser-arrowscrollbox {
  min-height: 0 !important;
  height: var(--lhde-lh-tab-h) !important;
  max-height: var(--lhde-lh-tab-h) !important;
  align-items: stretch !important;
}
#tabbrowser-tabs { --tab-min-height: var(--lhde-lh-tab-h) !important; padding-inline: 0 !important; margin-inline: 0 !important; border: 0 !important; }
.tabbrowser-tab {
  padding: 0 !important;
  min-height: 0 !important;
  font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important;
  font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important;
  color: #45403d !important;
}
.tabbrowser-tab:not([pinned]) { max-width: 200px !important; }
.tabbrowser-tab + .tabbrowser-tab { margin-inline-start: -1px !important; }
.tabbrowser-tab, .tab-stack, .tab-content { height: var(--lhde-lh-tab-h) !important; max-height: var(--lhde-lh-tab-h) !important; min-height: 0 !important; }
.tab-stack { align-items: stretch !important; }
.tab-background {
  margin: 0 !important;
  min-height: 0 !important;
  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.36) !important;
  border-bottom: 0 !important;
  border-radius: 2px 2px 0 0 !important;
  outline: none !important;
  box-shadow: inset 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55), inset -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3) !important;
  background: linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.34), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02)) !important;
}
.tabbrowser-tab:hover > .tab-stack > .tab-background:not([selected], [multiselected]) {
  background: linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16)) !important;
}
.tab-background:is([selected], [multiselected]) {
  background: linear-gradient(rgba(251, 249, 247, 0.97), rgba(244, 240, 237, 0.95) 50%, rgba(224, 219, 215, 0.95) 50%, rgba(216, 211, 208, 0.95)) !important;
  box-shadow: inset 1px 1px #ffffff, inset -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6) !important;
}
.tab-content { padding-inline: 6px 3px !important; }
.tab-label { font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important; font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important; }
.tab-icon-image, .tab-throbber, .tab-icon-pending { margin-inline-end: 5px !important; }
.tab-close-button {
  width: 16px !important;
  height: 16px !important;
  padding: 3px !important;
  margin-inline-end: 0 !important;
  border-radius: 2px !important;
}
#tabs-newtab-button, #new-tab-button {
  --toolbarbutton-inner-padding: 3px !important;
  --toolbarbutton-outer-padding: 2px !important;
  --toolbarbutton-border-radius: 3px !important;
}
#TabsToolbar .toolbarbutton-1 { align-self: center !important; }
/*@END@*/

/*@IF lhglass@*/
/* the glass themes, composited: the band and the tab row are transparent in an ARGB window (mozilla.widget.use-argb-visuals)
   over luxwm's glass plate (_LHWM_EXTEND_FRAME from settings.ini [extend_frame] firefox = 0 0 61 0: the band's 36 rows, the
   tabs' 23 and luxwm's 2 lines; docs/CLIENT-PROTOCOL.md "Extended frames"); everything below them opaque. The menu bar,
   shown, pushes the tabs below the glass: the tab row then gets the caption's colour behind it (flxp's look without glass) */
:root, #main-window, body, #navigator-toolbox {
  background: transparent !important;
  appearance: none !important;
}
:root {
  --toolbox-bgcolor: transparent !important;
  --toolbox-bgcolor-inactive: transparent !important;
  --lhde-lh-field: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  --lhde-lh-glow: 0 0 0.5em #ffffff, 0 0 0.5em #ffffff, 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
}
#browser, #navigator-toolbox ~ * { background-color: #ffffff !important; }
#navigator-toolbox:has(#toolbar-menubar:not([inactive])) #TabsToolbar {
  background-color: var(--lhde-ff4-frame) !important;
  background-image: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image) !important;
  background-size: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image-size) !important;
  background-position: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image-pos) !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
}
/*@END@*/

/*@IF lhopaque@*/
/* without glass (a theme without it, asked for with --look longhorn): the band and the tab row continue the caption luxwm
   draws, its last row stretched as luxwm stretches the caption (as flxp's header shows luxwm's caption band continued) */
:root {
  --lhde-lh-field: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
  --lhde-lh-glow: none;
}
#navigator-toolbox {
  background-color: var(--lhde-ff4-frame) !important;
  background-image: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image) !important;
  background-size: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image-size) !important;
  background-position: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image-pos) !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  /* the line the content starts below, which luxwm draws on the glass */
  box-shadow: inset 0 -1px var(--lhde-ff4-shadow), inset 0 -2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) !important;
}
:root:-moz-window-inactive #navigator-toolbox {
  background-color: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-inactive) !important;
  background-image: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image-inactive) !important;
  background-size: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image-inactive-size) !important;
  background-position: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image-inactive-pos) !important;
}
/*@END@*/

/*@IF ff4@*/
/* ---- Firefox 4's look under the Longhorn themes ---------------------------------------------------------------------- */
/* Firefox 4's own: its Windows theme (browser/themes/winstripe/browser/browser.css and browser-aero.css of the 4.0 release,
   Mozilla's, MPL 1.1/GPL 2.0/LGPL 2.1: the values below are its values unless said otherwise) as it drew itself on Windows
   7 without glass ("Aero Basic"), with its pictures from share/firefox/ff4 (tab.png, Toolbar.png, close.png, newtab.png,
   reload-stop-go.png; MANIFEST there) copied into the profile's lhde-art/ff4/. Its orange Firefox button is not imitated
   (the menu stays Firefox's at the right).
   lhde's: the window frame and caption are luxwm's. Firefox 4 extended the frame behind the menu bar and the tabs
   (rgb(185,209,234) in Aero Basic); here the rows behind them continue the caption luxwm draws without glass: its last row
   (the frames_classic style's Window CAPTION, rendered by ut-dump), stretched with the caption's sizing margins as luxwm
   stretches it; measured in the lab at the seam under slate4051 and jade4074 (the caption's last row and the tab row's
   first the same colour along the row). Under the glass themes, composited, the glass itself (the ff4glass section below).
   The faces and sizes are the style's menu font, the toolbar colour under Slate the style's button face (a choice: Firefox
   4's hsl(214,44%,87%) is blue, Slate is grey). Back and Forward are Firefox 4's keyhole (its large back button), reload
   and stop at the address's end as Firefox 4 had them. */
:root {
  --toolbar-bgcolor: var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar) !important;
  --toolbar-color: #000000 !important;
  --toolbox-bgcolor: var(--lhde-ff4-frame) !important;
  --toolbox-bgcolor-inactive: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-inactive) !important;
  --toolbox-textcolor: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-text) !important;
  --toolbox-textcolor-inactive: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-text) !important;
  --tabs-navbar-separator-style: none !important;
  --toolbarbutton-icon-fill: #000000 !important;
  --toolbarbutton-hover-background: transparent !important;
  --toolbarbutton-active-background: transparent !important;
  --toolbar-field-background-color: #ffffff !important;
  --toolbar-field-color: #000000 !important;
  --toolbar-field-border-color: transparent !important;
  --toolbar-field-focus-background-color: #ffffff !important;
  --toolbar-field-focus-color: #000000 !important;
  --toolbar-field-focus-border-color: transparent !important;
  --urlbar-height: 24px !important;
  --urlbar-min-height: 24px !important;
  --urlbar-container-height: 24px !important;
  --urlbar-border-radius: 3px !important;
  --urlbarview-border-radius: 0px !important;
  --tab-border-radius: 0px !important;
  --tab-min-height: var(--lhde-ff4-tab-h) !important;
  --tab-block-margin: 0px !important;
  --tab-margin-block: 0px !important;
  --tab-shadow-max-size: 0px !important;
  --tab-selected-shadow: none !important;
  --tab-box-shadow-selected: none !important;
  --tab-background-color: transparent !important;
  --tab-background-color-selected: transparent !important;
  --tab-selected-bgcolor: transparent !important;
  --tab-background-color-hover: transparent !important;
  --tab-text-color: #000000 !important;
  --tab-text-color-selected: #000000 !important;
  --tab-border: none !important;
}
#navigator-toolbox {
  background-color: var(--lhde-ff4-frame) !important;
  background-image: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image) !important;
  background-size: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image-size) !important;
  background-position: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image-pos) !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  color: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-text) !important;
  /* #navigator-toolbox::after: the 1px ThreeDShadow line under the toolbars */
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--lhde-ff4-shadow) !important;
}
:root:-moz-window-inactive #navigator-toolbox {
  background-color: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-inactive) !important;
  background-image: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image-inactive) !important;
  background-size: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image-inactive-size) !important;
  background-position: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image-inactive-pos) !important;
}
#toolbar-menubar { order: 0; }
#TabsToolbar { order: 1; }
#nav-bar { order: 2; }
#nav-bar, #TabsToolbar, #PersonalToolbar, #toolbar-menubar {
  font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important;
  font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  border-top: 0 !important;
}

/* the menu bar: on the frame colour above the tabs (Firefox 4 put it there, in the title bar's colour); its items on a
   strip of white at half opacity with 4 px corners (browser-aero.css, #main-menubar), the hot item Firefox 4's menu hot
   frame (#aeccf1 over #fafbfd to #ebf3fd, its .splitmenu-menuitem[_moz-menuactive]) */
#toolbar-menubar:not([inactive]) {
  height: 24px !important;
  min-height: 24px !important;
  max-height: 24px !important;
  padding: 2px 4px 0 !important;
}
#toolbar-menubar {
  border: 0 !important;
  background: transparent !important;
  color: #000000 !important;
}
#toolbar-menubar > .toolbar-items, #menubar-items { height: 22px !important; align-items: stretch !important; }
#main-menubar {
  height: 22px !important;
  align-items: stretch !important;
  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5) !important;
  border-radius: 4px !important;
}
:root:-moz-window-inactive #main-menubar { background-color: transparent !important; }
#main-menubar > menu {
  padding: 0 6px !important;
  border: 1px solid transparent !important;
  border-radius: 3px !important;
}
#main-menubar > menu:is([_moz-menuactive="true"], :hover, [open]) {
  border-color: #aeccf1 !important;
  background: linear-gradient(#fafbfd, #ebf3fd) !important;
}

/* the tab row: the frame colour, Firefox 4's shadow line under the tabs (rgba(10%,10%,10%,.4)) with a faint shade above
   it; 4 px at the sides as a restored window's tab row on Windows 7 */
#TabsToolbar {
  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.4) 1px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05) 1px, transparent 50%) !important;
  color: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-text) !important;
  padding: var(--lhde-ff4-tabs-top) 4px 0 !important;
  min-height: 0 !important;
  border-bottom: 0 !important;
}
#TabsToolbar :is(.toolbar-items, #TabsToolbar-customization-target), #tabbrowser-tabs, #tabbrowser-arrowscrollbox {
  min-height: 0 !important;
  height: var(--lhde-ff4-tab-h) !important;
  max-height: var(--lhde-ff4-tab-h) !important;
  align-items: stretch !important;
}
#tabbrowser-tabs { --tab-min-height: var(--lhde-ff4-tab-h) !important; padding-inline: 0 !important; border: 0 !important; }
.tabbrowser-tab {
  padding: 0 !important;
  min-height: 0 !important;
  font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important;
  font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important;
  color: #000000 !important;
}
.tabbrowser-tab, .tab-stack, .tab-content { height: var(--lhde-ff4-tab-h) !important; max-height: var(--lhde-ff4-tab-h) !important; min-height: 0 !important; }
.tab-stack { align-items: stretch !important; }
/* a tab: tab.png as its border (6 3 4), the background inside it 1 px from the sides and 2 px from the top, the corners
   7 px round; unselected: the toolbar colour under Firefox 4's darkening texture and the row's shadow line; hot: the
   lighter texture; selected: white to half white over the toolbar colour, joined to the navigation bar */
.tab-background {
  margin: 0 !important;
  min-height: 0 !important;
  border: 0 !important;
  border-radius: 7px 7px 0 0 !important;
  outline: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  border-image: var(--lhde-ff4-tab) 6 3 4 / 6px 3px 4px repeat stretch !important;
  background-color: transparent !important;
  background-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.4) 1px, transparent 1px),
                    linear-gradient(transparent, hsla(0, 0%, 45%, 0.1) 1px, hsla(0, 0%, 32%, 0.2) 80%, hsla(0, 0%, 0%, 0.2)),
                    linear-gradient(var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar), var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar)) !important;
  background-origin: border-box !important;
  background-position: 1px 2px !important;
  background-size: calc(100% - 2px) calc(100% - 2px) !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
}
.tabbrowser-tab:hover > .tab-stack > .tab-background:not([selected], [multiselected]) {
  background-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.4) 1px, transparent 1px),
                    linear-gradient(hsla(0, 0%, 100%, 0.3) 1px, hsla(0, 0%, 75%, 0.2) 80%, hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.2)),
                    linear-gradient(var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar), var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar)) !important;
}
.tab-background:is([selected], [multiselected]) {
  background-image: linear-gradient(#ffffff, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5) 50%),
                    linear-gradient(var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar), var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar)) !important;
}
.tab-content { padding-inline: 6px 4px !important; padding-top: 1px !important; }
.tab-label { font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important; font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important; }
.tab-icon-image, .tab-throbber { margin-inline: 2px 3px !important; }
/* the close button: close.png, its four 16 px states (selected, hot, pressed, unselected) */
.tab-close-button {
  list-style-image: none !important;
  width: 16px !important;
  height: 16px !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  margin-inline-end: 0 !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  background: var(--lhde-ff4-close) no-repeat -48px 0 !important;
  -moz-context-properties: none !important;
}
.tabbrowser-tab[visuallyselected] .tab-close-button { background-position: 0 0 !important; }
.tab-close-button:hover { background-position: -16px 0 !important; }
.tab-close-button:hover:active { background-position: -32px 0 !important; }
/* the new tab button: a 30 px tab of its own (newtab.png) */
#tabs-newtab-button, #new-tab-button {
  appearance: none !important;
  width: 30px !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  border: 0 !important;
  border-radius: 7px 7px 0 0 !important;
  border-image: var(--lhde-ff4-tab) 6 3 4 / 6px 3px 4px repeat stretch !important;
  background-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.4) 1px, transparent 1px),
                    linear-gradient(transparent, hsla(0, 0%, 45%, 0.1) 1px, hsla(0, 0%, 32%, 0.2) 80%, hsla(0, 0%, 0%, 0.2)),
                    linear-gradient(var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar), var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar)) !important;
  background-origin: border-box !important;
  background-position: 1px 2px !important;
  background-size: calc(100% - 2px) calc(100% - 2px) !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
}
#tabs-newtab-button:hover, #new-tab-button:hover {
  background-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.4) 1px, transparent 1px),
                    linear-gradient(hsla(0, 0%, 100%, 0.3) 1px, hsla(0, 0%, 75%, 0.2) 80%, hsla(0, 0%, 60%, 0.2)),
                    linear-gradient(var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar), var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar)) !important;
}
:is(#tabs-newtab-button, #new-tab-button) > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  list-style-image: none !important;
  width: 16px !important;
  height: 18px !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  margin: 2px auto 0 !important;
  border: 0 !important;
  background: var(--lhde-ff4-newtab) no-repeat 0 0 !important;
}
:is(#tabs-newtab-button, #new-tab-button):hover:active > .toolbarbutton-icon { background-position: -16px 0 !important; }
#TabsToolbar .toolbarbutton-1:not(#tabs-newtab-button, #new-tab-button) > .toolbarbutton-icon { background: none !important; }

/* the navigation bar: the toolbar colour, white at half opacity fading out downwards; 4 px above and below the keyhole */
#nav-bar {
  background-color: var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar) !important;
  background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0)) !important;
  color: #000000 !important;
  border-bottom: 0 !important;
  padding: 4px 2px 4px 4px !important;
  min-height: 0 !important;
}
#PersonalToolbar {
  background: var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar) !important;
  color: #000000 !important;
  border-top: 0 !important;
}
#nav-bar-customization-target { align-items: center !important; }

/* the toolbar buttons: Firefox 4's glassy frame (#nav-bar .toolbarbutton-1), drawn on the icon box; its icons from
   Toolbar.png (18 px cells) where Firefox 4 had one for the button, Firefox's own icons for the rest */
#nav-bar .toolbarbutton-1 {
  padding: 0 !important;
  margin: 0 2px !important;
  --toolbarbutton-inner-padding: 0px !important;
}
#nav-bar .toolbarbutton-1 > :is(.toolbarbutton-icon, .toolbarbutton-badge-stack) {
  box-sizing: content-box !important;
  width: 18px !important;
  height: 18px !important;
  padding: 1px 3px !important;
  border: 1px solid !important;
  border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.19) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.38) !important;
  border-radius: 4.5px !important;
  background: rgba(151, 152, 153, 0.05)
              linear-gradient(rgba(251, 252, 253, 0.95), rgba(246, 247, 248, 0.47) 49%, rgba(231, 232, 233, 0.45) 51%, rgba(225, 226, 229, 0.3)) !important;
  background-clip: padding-box !important;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3) inset, 0 0 0 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) inset, 0 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) !important;
}
#nav-bar .toolbarbutton-1 > .toolbarbutton-badge-stack > .toolbarbutton-icon { width: 16px !important; height: 16px !important; padding: 1px !important; }
#nav-bar .toolbarbutton-1:not([disabled]):not([open], :active):hover > :is(.toolbarbutton-icon, .toolbarbutton-badge-stack) {
  background-color: hsla(190, 60%, 70%, 0.5) !important;
  border-color: hsla(190, 50%, 65%, 0.8) hsla(190, 50%, 50%, 0.8) hsla(190, 50%, 40%, 0.8) !important;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3) inset, 0 0 0 1.5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) inset, 0 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),
              0 0 3.5px hsl(190, 90%, 80%) !important;
}
#nav-bar .toolbarbutton-1:not([disabled]):is([open], [checked], :hover:active) > :is(.toolbarbutton-icon, .toolbarbutton-badge-stack) {
  background-color: transparent !important;
  border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) !important;
  box-shadow: 0 0 6.5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) inset, 0 0 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) inset, 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) !important;
}
#nav-bar .toolbarbutton-1[disabled] > .toolbarbutton-icon { opacity: 0.5 !important; }
#nav-bar :is(#home-button, #downloads-button, #reload-button, #stop-button, #forward-button, #back-button, #print-button,
  #bookmarks-menu-button, #history-panelmenu, #new-window-button, #fullscreen-button) > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  list-style-image: var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar-png) !important;
  object-fit: none !important;
  overflow: clip !important;
  overflow-clip-margin: content-box !important;   /* the neighbouring cells stay out of the padding */
  -moz-context-properties: none !important;
}
#forward-button > .toolbarbutton-icon { object-position: -18px 0 !important; }
#stop-button > .toolbarbutton-icon { object-position: -36px 0 !important; }
#reload-button > .toolbarbutton-icon { object-position: -54px 0 !important; }
#home-button > .toolbarbutton-icon { object-position: -72px 0 !important; }
#downloads-button > .toolbarbutton-badge-stack > .toolbarbutton-icon { list-style-image: var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar-png) !important; object-fit: none !important; overflow: clip !important; overflow-clip-margin: content-box !important; object-position: -90px 0 !important; -moz-context-properties: none !important; }
#history-panelmenu > .toolbarbutton-icon { object-position: -108px 0 !important; }
#bookmarks-menu-button > .toolbarbutton-icon { object-position: -126px 0 !important; }
#print-button > .toolbarbutton-icon { object-position: -144px 0 !important; }
#new-window-button > .toolbarbutton-icon { object-position: -180px 0 !important; }
#fullscreen-button > .toolbarbutton-icon { object-position: -252px 0 !important; }

/* the keyhole: Back a 30 px round button with the large arrow (Toolbar.png's second row, 20 px), Forward under it
   cut by Firefox 4's mask (keyhole-forward-mask.svg: a circle at -46% of its width, radius 63%; hot: -35%, 58%) */
#nav-bar #back-button { margin: -2px 0 -2px 0 !important; position: relative !important; z-index: 1 !important; }
#nav-bar #back-button > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  width: 30px !important;
  height: 30px !important;
  padding: 5px !important;
  border: 0 !important;
  border-radius: 10000px !important;
  object-position: 0 -18px !important;
  background: linear-gradient(rgba(251, 252, 253, 0.97), rgba(246, 247, 248, 0.5) 49%, rgba(231, 232, 233, 0.45) 51%, rgba(225, 226, 229, 0.2)),
              var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar) !important;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3) inset, 0 0 0 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) inset, 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15),
              0 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 1px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) !important;
}
#nav-bar #back-button:not([disabled]):not([open], :active):hover > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  background-color: transparent !important;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3) inset, 0 0 0 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) inset, 0 0 0 1px hsla(190, 50%, 40%, 0.3),
              0 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 1px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), 0 0 5px 1px hsl(190, 90%, 80%) !important;
}
#nav-bar #back-button:not([disabled]):is([open], :hover:active) > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  box-shadow: 0 0 6.5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) inset, 0 0 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) inset, 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65),
              0 2px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) !important;
}
#nav-bar #back-button[disabled] > .toolbarbutton-icon { opacity: 1 !important; }
#nav-bar #forward-button { margin-inline: -6px 2px !important; }
#nav-bar #forward-button > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  padding: 1px 3px 1px 7px !important;
  border-left-style: none !important;
  border-radius: 0 4.5px 4.5px 0 !important;
  object-position: -18px 0 !important;
  mask-image: radial-gradient(63% 63% at -46% 50%, transparent 99%, #000000 100%) !important;
}
#nav-bar #forward-button:not([disabled]):not(:active):hover > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  mask-image: radial-gradient(58% 58% at -35% 50%, transparent 99%, #000000 100%) !important;
}
#nav-bar :is(#back-button, #forward-button)[disabled] > .toolbarbutton-icon { opacity: 1 !important; }

/* the location bar and the search box: white, Firefox 4's borders (rgba(0,0,0,.25) .32 .37 from the top), 1 px inset
   shade and the white line under it, 3 px between the bar's items */
#urlbar-container { order: 1; flex: 1 1 auto !important; margin-inline: 3px 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; }
#urlbar, #urlbar-input, #searchbar, .tab-label { font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important; font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important; }
#urlbar .urlbar-background, #searchbar-new .urlbar-background, #search-container .urlbar-background, #searchbar {
  border-radius: 3px !important;
  border: 1px solid !important;
  border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.37) !important;
  background-color: #ffffff !important;
  box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) inset, 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) !important;
  outline: none !important;
}
/* reload and stop at the location bar's end, as Firefox 4 had them in it: reload-stop-go.png's 14 px cells, the separator
   rgba(0,0,0,.25), hot reload blue, stop red (its gradients) */
#nav-bar #stop-reload-button { order: 2; margin-inline: -1px 0 !important; }
#nav-bar #stop-reload-button > .toolbarbutton-1 { margin: 0 !important; }
#nav-bar #stop-reload-button > .toolbarbutton-1 > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  box-sizing: content-box !important;
  width: 14px !important;
  height: 14px !important;
  padding: 4px 4px 4px 3px !important;
  list-style-image: var(--lhde-ff4-reload) !important;
  object-fit: none !important;
  overflow: clip !important;
  overflow-clip-margin: content-box !important;
  object-position: 0 0 !important;
  border: 1px solid !important;
  border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.37) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) !important;
  border-radius: 0 3px 3px 0 !important;
  background: #ffffff !important;
  box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) inset !important;
}
#nav-bar #stop-reload-button #reload-button:not([disabled]):hover > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  object-position: -14px 0 !important;
  background: linear-gradient(rgb(162, 207, 241), rgb(111, 178, 225) 49%, rgb(91, 159, 217) 51%, rgb(62, 138, 200)) !important;
  box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) inset, -1px -1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25) inset !important;
}
#nav-bar #stop-reload-button #stop-button > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  object-position: -28px 0 !important;
  background: linear-gradient(rgb(231, 162, 140), rgb(209, 119, 100) 49%, rgb(193, 92, 78) 51%, rgb(173, 72, 58)) !important;
  box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) inset, -1px -1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25) inset !important;
}
#nav-bar #stop-reload-button #stop-button:not([disabled]):hover > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  background: linear-gradient(rgb(244, 156, 128), rgb(215, 101, 77) 49%, rgb(194, 66, 48) 51%, rgb(170, 41, 23)) !important;
}
#urlbar-container:has(+ #stop-reload-button) #urlbar .urlbar-background { border-start-end-radius: 0 !important; border-end-end-radius: 0 !important; }
#search-container {
  order: 3;
  min-width: var(--lhde-search-w) !important;
  max-width: var(--lhde-search-w) !important;
  width: var(--lhde-search-w) !important;
  margin-inline: 6px 2px !important;
  font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important;
  font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important;
}
#nav-bar-customization-target > :is(#downloads-button, #unified-extensions-button, #fxa-toolbar-menu-button, #library-button,
  #home-button, #PanelUI-button) { order: 4; }
/*@END@*/

/*@IF ff4glass@*/
/* ---- the glass themes, composited: the menu bar and the tabs on luxwm's glass ----------------------------------------- */
/* Firefox 4 on Windows 7 with glass extended the frame behind the menu bar and the tabs. Here luxwm does: Firefox runs with an
   ARGB window (user.js mozilla.widget.use-argb-visuals), leaves the top of its window transparent, and luxwm paints its glass
   plate under it (_LHWM_EXTEND_FRAME, which luxwm sets on Firefox from settings.ini [extend_frame] firefox = 0 0 28 0:
   lhde-firefox install writes the tab row's rows; docs/CLIENT-PROTOCOL.md "Extended frames"). Only while a compositor runs
   (-moz-gtk-csd-transparency-available; without one Firefox's window is opaque and the opaque rules above stand). Firefox
   4's own for glass (browser-aero.css, -moz-windows-compositor): no background on the tab row, black text with a white
   glow on the glass. Its shadow line along the navigation bar's top is luxwm's here: the extension ends where the
   navigation bar begins, so luxwm's inner edge lines run under the tab row and on down the sides of the opaque rows (the
   frame's outline round the controls; an opaque row inside the extension has no edge at the sides, and the bar's rounded
   corners left the plate's pixels out). The menu bar, shown, pushes the tab row below the glass: it then gets the caption's
   colour behind it, as without glass. */
@media (-moz-gtk-csd-transparency-available) {
  :root, #main-window, body, #navigator-toolbox, #titlebar {
    background: transparent !important;
    appearance: none !important;
  }
  :root {
    --toolbox-bgcolor: transparent !important;
    --toolbox-bgcolor-inactive: transparent !important;
    --toolbox-textcolor: #000000 !important;
    --toolbox-textcolor-inactive: #000000 !important;
  }
  #navigator-toolbox, :root:-moz-window-inactive #navigator-toolbox { background: transparent !important; color: #000000 !important; }
  /* everything under the toolbars opaque: only the extended rows may show the plate */
  #browser, #navigator-toolbox ~ * { background-color: var(--lhde-ff4-toolbar) !important; }
  #toolbar-menubar, #TabsToolbar {
    color: #000000 !important;
    text-shadow: 0 0 0.5em #ffffff, 0 0 0.5em #ffffff, 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) !important;
  }
  .tabbrowser-tab { text-shadow: none !important; }
  #TabsToolbar { background: none !important; }
  #navigator-toolbox:has(#toolbar-menubar:not([inactive])) #TabsToolbar {
    background-color: var(--lhde-ff4-frame) !important;
    background-image: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image) !important;
    background-size: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image-size) !important;
    background-position: var(--lhde-ff4-frame-image-pos) !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  }
}
/*@END@*/

/*@IF xp@*/
/* ---- the XP look: Firefox 4's on XP in the theme's parts, Tahoma 8 pt --------------------------------------------- */
#toolbar-menubar { order: 0; }
#TabsToolbar { order: 1; }
#nav-bar { order: 2; }

/* the menu bar: a plain row in the window's face colour over the toolbars (Firefox 4's on XP), 22 rows as flxp's menu band
   under Luna, then the rebar's etched line (Rebar.BAND EDGESHADOWCOLOR over BTNHIGHLIGHT, flxp's line between its bands;
   classic: BTNSHADOW). Items: Tahoma 8, the first text 10 px from the left; hot raised 1 px (BTNHIGHLIGHT, BTNSHADOW),
   open sunken, as flxp's menu band (Internet Explorer 6's, measured under Luna) */
#toolbar-menubar:not([inactive]) {
  height: 24px !important;
  min-height: 24px !important;
  max-height: 24px !important;
  padding: 0 0 2px 2px !important;
  background: linear-gradient(to top, var(--lhde-xp-light) 0 1px, var(--lhde-xp-etch) 1px 2px, transparent 2px),
              var(--lhde-xp-face) !important;
}
#toolbar-menubar {
  border: 0 !important;
  color: var(--lhde-xp-text) !important;
}
#toolbar-menubar > .toolbar-items, #menubar-items, #main-menubar { height: 22px !important; align-items: stretch !important; }
#main-menubar > menu {
  padding: 0 8px 0 7px !important;
  margin: 1px 0 2px !important;
  border: 1px solid transparent !important;
}
#main-menubar > menu:is([_moz-menuactive="true"], :hover) {
  border-color: var(--lhde-xp-light) var(--lhde-xp-shadow) var(--lhde-xp-shadow) var(--lhde-xp-light) !important;
}
#main-menubar > menu[open] {
  border-color: var(--lhde-xp-shadow) var(--lhde-xp-light) var(--lhde-xp-light) var(--lhde-xp-shadow) !important;
}

/* Firefox 4's look on XP (its screenshots at 96 dpi), in the style's parts. Measured there: the tab row in BTNFACE with
   the selected tab joined to the navigation toolbar below it, that toolbar 36 rows from near white to BTNFACE with a
   BTNSHADOW line under it. Luna's own: the tabs are the style's Tab.TABITEM (rounded, the orange line of the hot and
   selected tab), the line under them the selected tab's edge, the toolbar buttons' frames Toolbar.BUTTON, the fields'
   border 127 157 185 (flxp's address bar). Without a style (classic): Windows' tab control drawn with the 3D colours.
   Taste, Firefox 4's own and not XP's: the round 32 px Back button with Forward tucked against it (flxp's XP toolbar has
   Internet Explorer's flat Back and Forward). Firefox 4's orange application button is Firefox's, not XP's, and is not
   imitated: the menu is Firefox's current one at the right. The window frame stays luxwm's: Firefox 4 drew its tabs in
   the title bar only on Vista and 7 with glass, on XP the frame was the system's (docs/USAGE.md). */
:root {
  --toolbar-bgcolor: var(--lhde-xp-face) !important;
  --toolbar-color: var(--lhde-xp-text) !important;
  --toolbox-bgcolor: var(--lhde-xp-face) !important;
  --toolbox-bgcolor-inactive: var(--lhde-xp-face) !important;
  --toolbox-textcolor: var(--lhde-xp-text) !important;
  --toolbox-textcolor-inactive: var(--lhde-xp-text) !important;
  --toolbarbutton-icon-fill: var(--lhde-xp-text) !important;
  --toolbarbutton-hover-background: transparent !important;
  --toolbarbutton-active-background: transparent !important;
  --toolbar-field-background-color: #ffffff !important;
  --toolbar-field-color: #000000 !important;
  --toolbar-field-border-color: var(--lhde-xp-field-border) !important;
  --toolbar-field-focus-background-color: #ffffff !important;
  --toolbar-field-focus-color: #000000 !important;
  --toolbar-field-focus-border-color: var(--lhde-xp-field-border) !important;
  --urlbar-height: 22px !important;
  --urlbar-min-height: 22px !important;
  --urlbar-border-radius: 0px !important;
  --urlbarview-border-radius: 0px !important;
  --tab-border-radius: 0px !important;
  --tab-min-height: 23px !important;
  --tab-block-margin: 0px !important;
  --tab-margin-block: 0px !important;
  --tab-shadow-max-size: 0px !important;
  --tab-selected-shadow: none !important;
  --tab-box-shadow-selected: none !important;
  --tab-background-color: transparent !important;
  --tab-background-color-selected: transparent !important;
  --tab-selected-bgcolor: transparent !important;
  --tab-background-color-hover: transparent !important;
  --tab-text-color: var(--lhde-xp-text) !important;
  --tab-text-color-selected: var(--lhde-xp-text) !important;
  --tabs-navbar-separator-style: none !important;
}
#navigator-toolbox { background: var(--lhde-xp-face) !important; color: var(--lhde-xp-text) !important; }
#nav-bar, #TabsToolbar, #PersonalToolbar {
  color: var(--lhde-xp-text) !important;
  font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important;
  font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important;
  border-top: 0 !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
}

/* the tab row: BTNFACE, 2 rows above the tabs, the line under them (the selected tab covers it) */
#TabsToolbar {
  background: linear-gradient(to top, var(--lhde-xp-tab-line) 0 1px, transparent 1px), var(--lhde-xp-face) !important;
  border-bottom: 0 !important;
  padding-top: 2px !important;
  min-height: 0 !important;
  height: 26px !important;
  max-height: 26px !important;
}
#TabsToolbar :is(.toolbar-items, #TabsToolbar-customization-target), #tabbrowser-tabs, #tabbrowser-arrowscrollbox {
  min-height: 0 !important;
  height: 24px !important;
  max-height: 24px !important;
  align-items: stretch !important;
}
#tabbrowser-tabs { --tab-min-height: 23px !important; padding-inline: 2px 0 !important; border: 0 !important; }
.tabbrowser-tab {
  padding: 0 !important;
  min-height: 24px !important;
  font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important;
  font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important;
  color: var(--lhde-xp-text) !important;
}
.tabbrowser-tab, .tab-stack, .tab-content { height: 24px !important; max-height: 24px !important; min-height: 0 !important; }
.tabbrowser-tab:not(:first-child) { margin-inline-start: -1px !important; }
.tab-stack { align-items: stretch !important; }
/* the unselected tabs 2 rows lower and 1 row short of the line (XP's tab control: the selected tab is 2 rows taller) */
/* the classic tab is the 1 px border (BTNHIGHLIGHT left and top, BTNSHADOW right) on BTNFACE; a style's picture covers it */
.tab-background {
  margin: 2px 0 1px !important;
  min-height: 0 !important;
  border: 1px solid !important;
  border-color: var(--lhde-xp-light) var(--lhde-xp-dark) transparent var(--lhde-xp-light) !important;
  border-bottom: 0 !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  outline: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  background: var(--lhde-xp-face) padding-box !important;
  border-image: var(--lhde-xp-tab-normal) 6 fill / 6px stretch !important;
}
.tabbrowser-tab:hover > .tab-stack > .tab-background:not([selected], [multiselected]) {
  border-image: var(--lhde-xp-tab-hot) 6 fill / 6px stretch !important;
}
.tab-background:is([selected], [multiselected]) {
  margin: 0 !important;
  border-image: var(--lhde-xp-tab-selected) 6 fill / 6px 6px 0 6px stretch !important;
}
.tab-content { padding-inline: 6px 3px !important; }
.tabbrowser-tab:not([selected]) .tab-content { padding-top: 2px !important; }
.tab-label { font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important; font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important; }
.tab-close-button { width: 16px !important; height: 16px !important; padding: 3px !important; margin-inline-end: 0 !important; }
#tabs-newtab-button, #new-tab-button { --toolbarbutton-inner-padding: 3px !important; }

/* the navigation toolbar: from the selected tab's bottom colour to BTNFACE, the BTNSHADOW line under it */
#nav-bar {
  background: linear-gradient(var(--lhde-xp-nav-top), var(--lhde-xp-face)) !important;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--lhde-xp-shadow) !important;
  min-height: 37px !important;
  padding-block: 1px !important;
}
#PersonalToolbar {
  background: var(--lhde-xp-face) !important;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--lhde-xp-shadow) !important;
}
#urlbar-container { order: 1; }
#stop-reload-button { order: 2; }
#search-container { order: 3; }
#nav-bar-customization-target > :is(#downloads-button, #unified-extensions-button, #fxa-toolbar-menu-button, #library-button) { order: 4; }
#urlbar, #urlbar-input, #searchbar, .tab-label { font-family: var(--lhde-font) !important; font-size: var(--lhde-font-size) !important; }
#urlbar .urlbar-background, #searchbar-new .urlbar-background, #search-container .urlbar-background {
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  border: 1px solid var(--lhde-xp-field-border) !important;
  background-color: #ffffff !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  outline: none !important;
}

/* the toolbar buttons: Toolbar.BUTTON's hot, pressed and checked frames (classic: raised and sunken 1 px) */
:is(#nav-bar, #PersonalToolbar, #TabsToolbar) .toolbarbutton-1 > :is(.toolbarbutton-icon, .toolbarbutton-badge-stack, .toolbarbutton-text) {
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  border: 1px solid transparent !important;
  background: none !important;
}
:is(#nav-bar, #PersonalToolbar, #TabsToolbar) .toolbarbutton-1:not([disabled]):hover > :is(.toolbarbutton-icon, .toolbarbutton-badge-stack) {
  border-color: var(--lhde-xp-light) var(--lhde-xp-shadow) var(--lhde-xp-shadow) var(--lhde-xp-light) !important;
  border-image: var(--lhde-xp-tb-hot) 4 fill / 4px stretch !important;
}
:is(#nav-bar, #PersonalToolbar, #TabsToolbar) .toolbarbutton-1:not([disabled]):is(:hover:active, [open]) > :is(.toolbarbutton-icon, .toolbarbutton-badge-stack) {
  border-color: var(--lhde-xp-shadow) var(--lhde-xp-light) var(--lhde-xp-light) var(--lhde-xp-shadow) !important;
  border-image: var(--lhde-xp-tb-pressed) 4 fill / 4px stretch !important;
}
:is(#nav-bar, #PersonalToolbar) .toolbarbutton-1:not([disabled]):is([checked], [starred]) > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  border-color: var(--lhde-xp-shadow) var(--lhde-xp-light) var(--lhde-xp-light) var(--lhde-xp-shadow) !important;
  border-image: var(--lhde-xp-tb-checked) 4 fill / 4px stretch !important;
}

/* taste, Firefox 4's: Back a round 32 px button, Forward a smaller one tucked against its right (the keyhole) */
#back-button, #forward-button {
  padding: 0 !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  align-self: center !important;
}
#back-button { position: relative !important; z-index: 2 !important; margin-inline-start: 3px !important; }
#forward-button { position: relative !important; z-index: 1 !important; }
#back-button[disabled], #forward-button[disabled] { opacity: 1 !important; }
#nav-bar #back-button > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  width: 32px !important;
  height: 32px !important;
  padding: 7px !important;
  border: 1px solid var(--lhde-xp-shadow) !important;
  border-radius: 50% !important;
  background: linear-gradient(#ffffff, var(--lhde-xp-face)) !important;
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px #ffffff !important;
  border-image: none !important;
}
#nav-bar #forward-button > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  width: 30px !important;
  height: 22px !important;
  padding: 2px 3px 2px 9px !important;
  margin-inline-start: -7px !important;
  border: 1px solid var(--lhde-xp-shadow) !important;
  border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0 !important;
  background: linear-gradient(#ffffff, var(--lhde-xp-face)) !important;
  border-image: none !important;
}
#nav-bar :is(#back-button, #forward-button):not([disabled]):hover > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  background: linear-gradient(#ffffff, var(--lhde-xp-nav-top)) !important;
  border-color: var(--lhde-xp-field-border) !important;
  border-image: none !important;
}
#nav-bar :is(#back-button, #forward-button):not([disabled]):hover:active > .toolbarbutton-icon {
  background: linear-gradient(var(--lhde-xp-face), #ffffff) !important;
  border-image: none !important;
}
#back-button[disabled] > .toolbarbutton-icon, #forward-button[disabled] > .toolbarbutton-icon { opacity: 1 !important; }
#back-button[disabled] .toolbarbutton-icon, #forward-button[disabled] .toolbarbutton-icon { fill: var(--lhde-xp-shadow) !important; }
/*@END@*/
